      </p>
      <span
        className="sr-only"
        data-testid="keyboard-tile"
        aria-live="polite"
        aria-atomic="true"
      >
        键盘选中地格 {keyboardTile.x},{keyboardTile.y}
      </span>

      <header className="top-bar">
        <div>
          <p className="eyebrow">古城营造司 · 民生簿</p>
          <h1>河洛原</h1>
        </div>
        <dl className="hud" aria-label="运行状态">
          <div>
            <dt>状态</dt>
            <dd data-testid="game-status">{gameStatus}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>渲染</dt>
